+The review is complete. I read the full 28-file diff at `651666a..d4673f8`, the KB article, and cross-checked the committed state of the driver, contract, RNG, netfile, scenario, metrics, and asyncapi files. One process note: I could not execute the Go test suite (command approval is unavailable in this session), so this is a close static review; I did verify cross-package test helpers, field names, and config defaults resolve correctly against the committed tree.
